OL,3,AWelsh county becomes global hotspot for
OL,4,Acarbon emissions after wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA county in Wales had one of the
OL,7,Fworld's highest carbon emissions per
OL,8,Fsquare kilometre due to wildfires in
OL,9,FJuly, according to a charity.
OL,11,FThe fire above Blaenavon, Torfaen was
OL,12,Fdescribed as "one of the largest and
OL,13,Fmost challenging" in south Wales in
OL,14,Frecent years by the fire service.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
