OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWelsh county becomes global hotspot for
OL,4,Acarbon emissions after wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FSave the Children said it was concerned
OL,7,Fabout possible health consequences
OL,8,Fafter data, external published by the
OL,9,FEuropean Union's earth observation
OL,10,Fprogramme, Copernicus, showed Torfaen
OL,11,Fbehind Malanje in Angola, Spain's Avila
OL,12,Fand Annaba in Algeria in terms of
OL,13,Fwildfire emissions in July.
OL,15,FTorfaen council said it was unaware of
OL,16,Fthe EU data but its own air quality
OL,17,Fmonitoring showed "elevated particulate
OL,18,Fconcentrations".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
